stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Draft

    Draft --> DrdoApprovalPending: submits, approval required
    Draft --> PaymentPending: submits, approval not required

    DrdoApprovalPending --> PaymentPending: DRDO approves
    DrdoApprovalPending --> Rejected: DRDO rejects

    PaymentPending --> PaymentCompleted: payment succeeds
    PaymentCompleted --> InProgress: assessment is scheduled
    InProgress --> Certified: assessment is certified

    Certified --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]

    Draft: Draft
    DrdoApprovalPending: DRDO approval pending
    PaymentPending: Payment pending
    PaymentCompleted: Payment completed
    InProgress: In progress
    Certified: Certified
    Rejected: Rejected
